{
 "_comment": "The Units (UNT V1.0, DRAFT 2026-10-31): what acquires data from the real world and what delivers data to it, in the Physical Layer of a User Agent. Units are not AIMs. Sixteen Units, by the author: acquisition AOA, SOA, TOA, VOA, LOA, ROA, UOA, NSA, SDA, WDA; delivery 3OD, AOD, MOD, SOD, TOD, VOD. Units acquire and deliver Basic and full objects and scenes. 'ports' are the Data Types a Unit takes and gives; 'status': code = the Unit has code in D:\\AI. Schemas: schemas/UNT/V1.0. The earlier proposals OMA and OMD are not in UNT V1.0.",
